+        // Cooper (GT-S5830) retro-port ships no SetupWizard, which is the
+        // only in-tree writer of DEVICE_PROVISIONED. Without a provisioned
+        // default the keyguard mediator restricts input forever and the HOME
+        // key is silently swallowed (it is routed to an unlock verification
